Comment: Binary build of the PrismML fork of llama.cpp
 (https://github.com/PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp, branch prism, commit
 e3de715222b2667c54a267441159a5729f11155e) with the patches in
 https://github.com/SatoruGoj0/Bonsai-Oryon/tree/claude/wonderful-curie-my0ukq/patches applied.
 llama.cpp and ggml were created by Georgi Gerganov and are developed by the
 ggml authors and contributors (see licenses/llama.cpp-AUTHORS); the PrismML
 fork adds the PQ2_0/PTQ1_0 formats and Bonsai model support (PrismML).
 The Ternary-Bonsai models are distributed separately by PrismML under their
 own terms and are NOT part of this package.

